Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.04,0:00:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,还有时间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.15,0:00:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,在石川同学来之前先打扫下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.54,0:00:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,不对 我这太受石川同学照顾了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.78,0:00:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,文化祭还总是让她帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.82,0:00:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,太对不起她了
Comment: 0,0:00:33.01,0:00:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,==========OP==========
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.66,0:02:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,文化祭时的石川同学 好帅啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.90,0:02:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,认真努力 还到处帮助同学
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.70,0:02:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,做事也机灵
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.13,0:02:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,客人也很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.73,0:02:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,明明比我都忙多了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.86,0:02:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,与之相比…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.57,0:02:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我都睡着了 真是太丢脸了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.73,0:02:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学那么体贴 虽然没说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.08,0:03:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前就一直这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.16,0:03:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.67,0:03:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 我来早了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.28,0:03:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.57,0:03:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,能进来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,请进
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.73,0:03:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,脸色变好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.52,0:03:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.83,0:03:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 给你添麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.61,0:03:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.09,0:03:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,都让你膝枕了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.86,0:03:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.32,0:03:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我还要跟你道歉的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.19,0:03:47.83,Default,,0,0,0,,什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.13,0:03:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,其实呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.69,0:03:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那时候
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.52,0:03:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,口水流到你头上了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.43,0:04:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,就这边
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.61,0:04:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们回去吧 石川同学
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.91,0:04:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,全都湿了 不知道怎么办了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.76,0:04:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,也找不到时机擦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.00,0:04:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,是感觉好像凉凉的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.80,0:04:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然你没说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.57,0:04:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,真的对不起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.62,0:04:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.10,0:04:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.92,0:04:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 还以为对我幻灭了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.45,0:04:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,幻灭？就因为口水吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.27,0:04:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学真是有意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.78,0:04:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,你笑什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.74,0:04:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.83,0:05:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.62,0:05:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,各位 文化祭辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.59,0:05:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,杰出女仆奖 恭喜获奖
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.77,0:05:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,各位都是获胜者
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.25,0:05:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.53,0:05:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,厉害啊 大鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.00,0:05:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,真好吃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.24,0:05:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.13,0:05:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我第一次店里吃这个
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.20,0:05:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学 嘴上有酱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.30,0:05:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,大鸟好奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.55,0:05:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,还是老样子那么要好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.11,0:05:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈等级上升了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.93,0:06:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,猪肉馅的来了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.26,0:06:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好好搅拌了再烧哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.86,0:06:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.42,0:06:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这次让我煎吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.25,0:06:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,很有干劲嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.99,0:06:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,月菜煎的 好期待呀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.39,0:06:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,大鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.50,0:06:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这边先看着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.94,0:06:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,预备起
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.62,0:06:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,还行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.32,0:06:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,各位盘子来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.05,0:06:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,第一次自己煎的大阪烧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.67,0:06:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.11,0:06:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学 没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.94,0:06:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,来 喝茶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.29,0:06:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,刚煎好的 得放凉点
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.84,0:06:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 不小心就
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.22,0:07:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,不能自己吃了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.80,0:07:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.76,0:07:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,刚才的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.44,0:07:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,看到你吹了 还以为要给我吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.14,0:07:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,好难为情
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.50,0:07:30.79,Default,,0,0,0,,来 石川同学
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.90,0:07:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了 我开动了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.19,0:07:37.88,Default,,0,0,0,,好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.33,0:07:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.53,0:07:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.19,0:07:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 佐久间
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.12,0:07:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,盯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.87,0:07:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,盯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.99,0:08:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,拿你没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,哇耶 谢谢你楠木
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.45,0:08:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.09,0:08:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.60,0:08:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,看这边 石川同学
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.70,0:08:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,要吃海鲜的大阪烧吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.89,0:08:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我来给你吹凉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.86,0:08:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 我想吃
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.35,0:08:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学 我这边也煎好了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.78,0:08:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我会诚心诚意地为您吹凉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.32,0:08:27.45,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.92,0:08:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,以现在的心境写一首
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.60,0:08:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.91,0:08:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,想要守护
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.74,0:08:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,于夏之将歇
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.84,0:08:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是我之前撕掉的签名板吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.41,0:08:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,废物利用啊 了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.28,0:08:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,大鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.61,0:08:55.49,Default,,0,0,0,,校门口的看板 真的做得超好的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.49,0:08:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.80,0:08:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都玩得很开心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.39,0:09:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,连我都忍不住心生雀跃了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.29,0:09:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢夸奖
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.45,0:09:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,对了 月菜
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.27,0:09:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,下一次一起去猫咖怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.53,0:09:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,猫咪？! 我要去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.71,0:09:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你生日时我送了票的那家
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.22,0:09:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,现在在搞猫咪小点心半价的优惠
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,太棒了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.19,0:09:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,楠木也一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.02,0:09:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我就算了 你们两个人去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.03,0:09:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,一起去吧 楠木
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.87,0:09:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,月菜酱  真期待我们一起出门玩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.91,0:09:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦好啦  吃了不少了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.97,0:09:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,拍拍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.99,0:09:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,拍拍…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.09,0:10:01.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这里就是…真期待啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.15,0:10:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦 进去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.15,0:10:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,两个人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.53,0:10:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.41,0:10:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,月菜酱 这里这里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.89,0:10:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 出动!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.72,0:10:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,真可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.47,0:10:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.43,0:10:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那孩子真活泼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.49,0:10:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,诶 楠木？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.66,0:10:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,美纱要是也一起来就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.76,0:10:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,在的在的  她人在的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.63,0:10:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.92,0:10:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,真是碰巧呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.50,0:10:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,嘛 我家就在这附近
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.50,0:10:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,偶尔就会来看看猫什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.03,0:10:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你这家伙是饿了么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.39,0:10:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,没办法 吃点小点心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.29,0:10:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,楠木  你好像蛮熟练的诶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.00,0:11:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 就如你所见!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我是这家的常客 不行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.27,0:11:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,悄咪咪地跑来看呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.18,0:11:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 所以我才不想暴露的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.25,0:11:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,小玉 好久不见咯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.12,0:11:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,长大了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.10,0:11:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,小玉？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.58,0:11:27.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这孩子是美纱寄放在猫咖的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.07,0:11:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那个啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.61,0:11:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.43,0:11:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿嘿 我说出去的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.87,0:11:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,小猫咪来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.91,0:11:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这里的孩子都不怕生的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.47,0:11:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,真的耶 好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.48,0:11:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,真合适啊 帅气得很
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.03,0:11:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊  有模有样的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.35,0:11:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,哼哼  本人可是高贵的吸血鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.90,0:12:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,驯服小猫咪可不是手到擒来…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.49,0:12:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 别 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.39,0:12:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,按顺序来  按顺序来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.76,0:12:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,停下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.70,0:12:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,一转眼就被小觑了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.69,0:12:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,说起来 月菜酱之前也遇见过同样的事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.76,0:12:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,被温泉医生鱼袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.85,0:12:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这什么情况  真想亲眼看看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.75,0:12:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,住手哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.35,0:12:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,算啦算啦  我们也吃我们的小点心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.21,0:12:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,吃什么好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.72,0:12:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.27,0:12:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.08,0:12:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,麻烦给我一份蛋糕套餐
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.33,0:12:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.05,0:12:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,美纱要什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.18,0:12:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我就要曲奇套餐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.05,0:13:04.59,Default,,0,0,0,,去个厕所
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.23,0:13:08.27,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉慢慢地熟练起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.96,0:13:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你经常和瑛子出门玩吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.33,0:13:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.24,0:13:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,之前还去天文馆玩了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.62,0:13:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,这个沙发软乎乎的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.08,0:13:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,就像是躺在云朵上一样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.52,0:13:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这是你生日礼物那一整套票的地方吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,对的对的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.75,0:13:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这张是在电影院前拍的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.13,0:13:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,能吸佐久间的血之后
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.83,0:13:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我的活动范围就变大了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.86,0:13:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,石川你喜欢点心对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.35,0:13:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.16,0:13:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,最近好像 有家新店开业了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.01,0:13:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,真好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.31,0:13:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 怎么说…所以说…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.10,0:14:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,下次 一起去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.17,0:14:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我也会努力适应被咬的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.60,0:14:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 肯定愿意去的喵
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.51,0:14:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你这幅表情是怎么回事啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.88,0:14:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么啦怎么啦 发生什么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.48,0:14:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那个啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.80,0:14:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,喂!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.39,0:14:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,楠木  看你的手 被咬得好狠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.00,0:14:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,真的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.61,0:14:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么你也玩得兴奋起来了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.56,0:14:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不疼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.21,0:14:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,嘛 毕竟就是只小猫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.06,0:14:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.79,0:14:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,所以说 这究竟是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.68,0:14:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我想着只要想象成猫咪的话
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.51,0:14:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,就算被咬也没事的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.88,0:14:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,于是就做出来了!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.81,0:14:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.59,0:14:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.23,0:15:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,还是这一套更合适？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.17,0:15:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这种也不错
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,或者这种
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.35,0:15:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,还有这种
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.14,0:15:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,主旨变了吧？!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.17,0:15:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,不  果然还得是猫吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.09,0:15:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你只是在拿我玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.13,0:15:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不不 是真的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.92,0:15:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉现在的话没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.14,0:15:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.04,0:15:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,还是很疼!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.55,0:15:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,只需要再等一周就到了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.58,0:15:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,两位都要为我保密哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.52,0:15:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好好  可别兴奋过头了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.54,0:15:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,诶诶 可是你想想啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.30,0:16:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉你们聊得很开心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.42,0:16:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我们正在讨论给大鸟的惊喜派对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.11,0:16:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,月菜酱
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.23,0:16:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 都怪我和你们搭话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.18,0:16:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不是大鸟的错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.02,0:16:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,说实话 我早就猜到你会泄密
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.57,0:16:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,只是比我想的还快
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.38,0:16:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,大鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.05,0:16:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,啥事没有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,她最近看起来一直心情很好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.50,0:16:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,原来这么个事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.89,0:16:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,其实 她本来打算保密的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.42,0:16:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,乖乖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.79,0:16:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,弄哭她了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,这样吧 石川同学
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.26,0:16:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,在那天以前 我们先保持距离如何
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.43,0:16:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,这样或许还能保持一些新鲜感
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.48,0:17:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.82,0:17:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得不行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.89,0:17:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,那么 大鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,要做就做到底
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.04,0:17:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,等我吸完血再开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.15,0:17:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 不着急
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.03,0:17:21.37,Default,,0,0,0,,令人担心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.47,0:17:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,像这样
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.41,0:17:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,干啥
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.66,0:17:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,你们咋了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.11,0:17:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我和石川同学开始分开生活
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.91,0:17:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,楠木 麻烦你待在这
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.41,0:17:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我要当墙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.68,0:17:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,美纱 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.97,0:17:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好温暖
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.07,0:17:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,幻想中的月菜酱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.73,0:18:00.65,Default,,0,0,0,,他俩吵架了吗 没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.65,0:18:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,没事没事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.51,0:18:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,月菜酱 大鸟君
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.10,0:18:11.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.24,0:18:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.78,0:18:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,和猫好好玩 把身心给治愈一下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.27,0:18:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我去拿猫零食
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.37,0:18:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 楠木同学
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.97,0:18:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,店里的猫全都
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.89,0:18:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好重
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.86,0:18:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,月菜酱
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.56,0:18:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,吃点甜食也能缓解情绪哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.28,0:19:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.11,0:19:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你在喝啥呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.74,0:19:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,味噌汤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.98,0:19:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,味噌汤？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.86,0:19:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这也是大鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.13,0:19:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你说啥呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.44,0:19:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,这是用在大鸟家买的味噌做的汤
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,佐久间 喝了它
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.67,0:19:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.27,0:19:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.32,0:19:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,你都这么说了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.77,0:19:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,真好喝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.07,0:19:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,让你那么盯着我喝不下去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.95,0:19:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,月菜酱 要不这样
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.49,0:19:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,吸我的血试试呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.18,0:19:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,可以吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.15,0:19:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.46,0:19:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.07,0:19:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,果然太可爱了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.05,0:19:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,佐久间
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.13,0:19:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,两位 没事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.19,0:20:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,一边因为压力大不断吃点心
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.38,0:20:06.52,Default,,0,0,0,,另一边明明没被吸血却一脸死气
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.92,0:20:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,仔细想想你们根本没必要保持距离啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.64,0:20:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我后来想 我其实也可以装不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.11,0:20:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,真温柔呀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.65,0:20:29.60,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉啊 石川同学
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.08,0:20:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,虽然称不上是惊喜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.07,0:20:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,但我还想说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.50,0:20:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我想帮你举办生日派对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.36,0:20:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你能来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.24,0:20:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,石川同学
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.24,0:20:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,当然的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.11,0:20:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.58,0:20:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,话说月菜酱 那是你亲手画的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.80,0:21:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我想要保留一点惊喜的感觉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.41,0:21:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,也给你们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.07,0:21:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.66,0:21:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,月菜酱 我好开心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.16,0:21:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈来电话
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.46,0:21:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,说是要在月菜家办派对
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.99,0:21:17.92,DefaultTop,,0,0,0,,我还是第一次收到邀请函
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.95,0:21:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,喂喂
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.80,0:21:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚给他们邀请函
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.50,0:21:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,没问题 我写日期了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.97,0:21:26.40,DefaultTop,,0,0,0,,大鸟君 你可是主角哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.86,0:21:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.34,0:21:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.52,0:21:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.84,0:21:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈问我大家都喜欢吃什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.42,0:21:47.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我爱吃炸鸡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.23,0:21:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是主角吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.31,0:21:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,还有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.65,0:21:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸好像要回来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.74,0:21:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候请多指教
